# MAHAT exam defaults

For every exam creation or revision in this project, follow `AGENTS.md` and
`מבחנים/mahat-exam-skill/SKILL.md`.

- Exclude special product identities and trinomial factorization from questions, solutions, and formula boxes.
- Do not mention significant figures anywhere in student exams or solutions.
- Require decimal answers to two places, rounding by the third digit, without intermediate rounding.
- These saved defaults still apply when the standard prompt says `החרגות: אין`; that means no additional exclusions.
- Override only on an explicit user request to change a saved preference.
- These rules concern exams, not the existing chapter exercise bank.
